:: Mansion Enter
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "garden">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

You walk up the hill towards Avery's mansion. The gates rattle open as you approach, allowing you entry.
<br><br>
<<if $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "away" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "work" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "sleep" and $avery_mansion.rage.work is true>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.rage.work to false>>
	<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
	Avery walks outside, <<his>> eyes locked on you.
	<br><br>
	<<avery_housework_assess home>>
<<elseif $avery_mansion.rage.party_missed is true>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.rage.party_missed to false>>
	<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>

	Avery walks outside, <<his>> eyes locked on you.
	<br><br>

	<<if $avery_mansion.guest is "Bailey_missed">>
		<<set $avery_mansion.guest to "Bailey">>
		"You missed the party," <<he>> says. "Bailey wasn't impressed. <<nnpc_He "Bailey">> walked out when <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> learned, but agreed to return <span class="gold"><<this_sunday>>.</span> Don't miss it again."<<ggarage>><<lllove>><<npcincr Avery love -3>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
	<<elseif $avery_mansion.guest is "Jordan_missed">>
		<<set $avery_mansion.guest to "Quinn">>
		"You missed the party," <<he>> says. "The temple people are a lot to handle, and I'd have felt better with you by my side. <span class="gold">The mayor has agreed to attend <<this_sunday>>'s party.</span> Try to be present.<<avery_mansion_tower_negative_effects "Bishop">><<ggarage>><<lllove>><<npcincr Avery love -3>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
	<<elseif $avery_mansion.guest is "Quinn_missed">>
		<<set $avery_mansion.guest to "Remy">>
		"You missed the party," <<he>> says. "The wouldn't stop telling jokes about you'd run off on me. They weren't funny, but of course everyone laughed. The sycophants. <span class="gold">Remy the farmer will be visiting <<this_sunday>>.</span> Don't disappoint me again."<<avery_mansion_tower_negative_effects "Quinn">>
		<<ggarage>><<lllove>><<npcincr Avery love -3>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
	<<elseif $avery_mansion.guest is "Remy_missed">>
		<<set $avery_mansion.guest to "Briar">>
		"You missed the party," <<he>> says. "You showed me up in front of some important people. Maybe you were shy? <span class="gold">The guest of honour <<this_sunday>> will be the whoremonger, Briar.</span> Perhaps <<nnpc_he Briar>>'ll be more on your level.<<avery_mansion_tower_negative_effects "Remy">>
		<<ggarage>><<lllove>><<npcincr Avery love -3>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
	<<elseif $avery_mansion.guest is "Briar_missed">>
		<<set $avery_mansion.guest to "Harper">>
		"You missed the party," <<he>> says. "I was relying on your presence. Briar had the gall to try flirting with me. <span class="gold">Harper the Doctor will be attending <<this_sunday>>.</span> Don't let their work fool you. They're very respectable. Be there."<<avery_mansion_tower_negative_effects "Briar">>
		<<ggarage>><<lllove>><<npcincr Avery love -3>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
	<<elseif $avery_mansion.guest is "Harper_missed">>
		<<if $avery_mansion.bishop_intro>>
			<<set $avery_mansion.guest to "Bishop">>
		<<else>>
			<<set $avery_mansion.guest to "Quinn">>
		<</if>>
		"You missed the party," <<he>> says. "I had to deal with such verminous guests on my own.
		<<if $avery_mansion.bishop_intro>>
			<span class="gold">The bishop from the temple will be visiting <<this_sunday>>.</span> Don't leave me to handle them alone."
		<<else>>
			<span class="gold">The mayor will be visiting next week.</span> Don't humiliate me by not showing.
		<</if>>
		<<avery_mansion_tower_negative_effects "Harper">>
		<<ggarage>><<lllove>><<npcincr Avery love -3>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule is "garden">>
	<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
	Avery works in the garden. <<He>> flashes you a smile.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

