	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you try to return to sleep.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100) and $averyragerevealed gte 1>>
		Avery rolls over, and punches the lamp on <<his>> bedside cabinet in frustration.
	<<else>>
